sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant S as SemanticSearch
  participant P as EmbeddingPipeline
  participant I as VectorIndex
  participant C as Corpus
  U->>S: search(query)
  S->>P: embed_query
  P-->>S: query vector
  S->>I: top-k(query vector)
  Note over I,C: docs embedded at ingest
  I-->>S: ranked SearchHits
  S-->>U: hits + scores + metadata
